    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ursodeoxycholic acid (UDCA) 13-15 mg/kg/day orally decreases liver damage, prolongs survival and delays transplantation; about 40% have ⍉biochem improvement after >= 12 months."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Second-line for inadeq UDCA response: seladelpar (PPAR delta) or elafibranor (PPAR α/delta) w UDCA, or alone if UDCA isn't tolerated; fibrates (bezafibrate isn't available in the US; fenofibrate = used) can raise aminotransferases and worsen renal funct."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "PPAR agonists, incl fibrates, aren't recommended in decompensated cirrhosis; obeticholic acid was withdrawn from the US market."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Cholestyramine (4-16 g/day for pruritus) decreases UDCA absorb, so don't give them together; other drugs go 1 hr b4 or 4 hrs after cholestyramine."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
